<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">Two offline replicas each increment a counter from zero to one. If synchronization keeps only the larger displayed number, both replicas can agree on one while losing an increment.</p>

<!-- @before Internal Mechanics :: animation -->
### Convergence must preserve the chosen operations

